vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: https://localhost:7165
}

docs {
  # Authentication

  The API uses a cookie, not a token. Call `Auth/post -api-Auth-login`
  (or `Auth/post -api-Auth-register`) first. Bruno keeps the cookie in
  its cookie jar and sends it on every later request.

  Keep `baseUrl` on `https://localhost:7165`. The auth cookie is marked
  `Secure`, so it is not sent over the plain `http://localhost:5077`
  profile and every authorised request would return 401.

  Bruno must trust the .NET development certificate. Run
  `dotnet dev-certs https --trust` once, or turn off SSL certificate
  verification in the Bruno settings.
}
